015 Directory: -MS_CAT.015
015 Diskette Label: BAS EPISTAT
015 Comments: Basic program for people interested in statistics.
015 ANOVA    BAS - Analysis of variance & the F distribution.
015 AUTOEXEC BAT - Batch file to auto start on boot up.
015 BAYES    BAS - Analysis using BAYE'S theory.
015 BINOMIAL BAS - generates binomial distributions.
015 CHISQR   BAS - Chi-square test distribution.
015 CORRELAT BAS - Computes correlation coefficients.
015 DATA-ONE BAS - Inputs or outputs data.
015 DOS      BAT - Copies DOS to this disk for drive A:.
015 EPIMRG   BAS - Used by all EPISTAT programs
015 EPISETUP BAK - Backup data file.
015 EPISETUP DAT - File used by all EPISTAT programs.
015 EPISTAT  BAS - The main program (like a menu).
015 FILETRAN BAS - Moves data between programs
015 FISHERS  BAS - Fisher's exact test.
015 FORTRANS BAS - Translates FORTRAN or SDF files into EPISTAT.
015 HISTOGRM BAS - Color, generate a histogram (screen/printer).
015 LNREGRES BAS - Linear regression analysis.
015 MCNEMAR  BAS - Paired chi-square test.
015 MHCHIMLT BAS - Test for multiple controls (Mantel-Haenszel).
015 MHCHISQR BAS - Mantel-Haenszel chi-square test.
015 NORMAL   BAS - Generates bell cure distribution.
015 POISSON  BAS - Generates position distribution.
015 PRINTDOC     -         Documentation.
015 RANDOMIZ BAS - Random sample generator for test purposes.
015 RANKTEST BAS - Provides the signed rank sum test.
015 RATEADJ  BAS - For rate adjustment, direct or indirect.
015 READ     ME  -         Documentation.
015 SAMPLSIZ BAS - Calculates sample size necessary for test.
015 SCATRGRM BAS - Color, generates a scattergram.
015 SELECT   BAS - User select any combination of data to report on.
015 T-TEST   BAS - Students T-test and T distribution.
015 XTAB     BAS - Generates crosstab reports.
***
